1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:01,960
(Raj:)Why are you
holding hands?

2
00:00:01,960 --> 00:00:03,950
(Raj:)I forbid you to hold hands.

3
00:00:03,950 --> 00:00:07,440
(Priya:)Rajesh, you know Leonard and I
spent the night together.

4
00:00:07,440 --> 00:00:09,120
(Raj:)Yeah, but you were just
sleeping,

5
00:00:09,120 --> 00:00:11,660
(Raj:)because I forboded you
to have sex.

6
00:00:12,690 --> 00:00:14,360
The word is "forbade""

7
00:00:14,360 --> 00:00:17,630
(Raj:)You sure?
That doesn't sound right.

8
00:00:17,630 --> 00:00:19,830
(Priya:)Listen, Rajesh, Leonard and I
have decided

9
00:00:19,830 --> 00:00:21,270
(Priya:)to see each other again,

10
00:00:21,270 --> 00:00:23,030
(Priya:)and you don't get
to tell me

11
00:00:23,040 --> 00:00:25,870
(Priya:)who I can and can't have
a relationship with.

12
00:00:25,870 --> 00:00:27,310
(Sheldon:)Actually, he can.

13
00:00:27,310 --> 00:00:31,780
(Sheldon:)The Hindu Code of Manu is
very clear in these matters.

14
00:00:31,780 --> 00:00:33,410
(Sheldon:)If a woman's father is
not around,

15
00:00:33,410 --> 00:00:36,880
(Sheldon:)the duty of controlling her base
desires falls

16
00:00:36,880 --> 00:00:41,720
(Sheldon:)to the closest male member of
her family, in this case, Raj.

17
00:00:41,720 --> 00:00:42,950
(Sheldon:)The code also states

18
00:00:42,960 --> 00:00:45,320
(Sheldon:)that if she disobeys,
she will be reborn

19
00:00:45,320 --> 00:00:50,130
"in the womb of a jackal
and tormented by diseases."

20
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:52,560
(Sheldon:)If true,

21
00:00:52,570 --> 00:00:55,000
(Sheldon:)that seems
like an awfully large gamble

22
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:01,020
(Sheldon:)given that the prize is Leonard.

